	+ GetAccountCondition
		| New Public Operation - returns the account condition codes
		> AccountNumber : int
		< IsLeaseEnd : bool
		< HasSpecialCircumstances : bool
		< ConditionFlags : AccountConditionFlags
		< Conditions : List<string> 

	+ GetAvailablePromotions
		| New Public Operation - This method returns list of promotion Ids and names based the account number.
		> AccountNumber : int
		< PromotionList : List<PromptionItemDto>

	* CreateQuote
		| New Public Operation - This method generates the quote based on the existing code.
		> AccountNumber : int
		< Quote : PayoffQuoteDto | Entities should not be returned from data providers

	* CreateLeaseEndQuote
		| New Public Operation - This method generates the ABC quote based on the existing code.  This calls CreateABCPayoffQuote. If the dealer has selected a promotion quote (ie pull ahead) the AbcCreatePayoffDTO.TurnInCode needs to be set to PullAheadPromotionCode and the  AbcCreatePayoffDTO.PromotionId should be set to the selected promotion Id if not the AbcCreatePayoffDTO.PromotionId = 0.
		| NOTE:  We have to change CreateAbcPayoffQuote() to facilitate a PromotionID. The code will need to have this change:
		|	if(AbcCreatePayoffDTO.PromotionId > 0)
		|		promotionId = payoffRequest.PromotionId;
		|	else (payoffRequest.TurnInCode == PullAheadPromotionCode)
		|		promotionId = GetPromotions(payoffRequest.FsDealerId, fsAccountId);
		> Quote : AbcCreatePayoffDTO 
		< Payoff : AbcPayoffDTO

